            "name": "Get space permissions",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns all permissions the authenticated user has within the given space. The user must be a member of that space. Includes both permissions assigned directly to the user and those inherited through group membership.\nEach permission entry may be scoped to the whole space, a specific location, or a specific camera. See the [Spaces section](#tag/space) for the full list of permission slugs and scoping rules.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
